Z||000000||Black88GT||09-08-2000||10:08 PM||||Hey, so whats everyone's Super bowl picks for this season.  I am jumping on the Redskins bandwagon, even though I am a Ravens fan.<P>Speaking of the Ravens, I hope you guys aren't still mad at Baltimore over the whole Cleveland Browns ordeal.  The reason everyone was so mad is because we actually got team when we were black listed after Ursay left in the middle of the night with our beloved Colts.  I never see that mentioned, how we lost a team and no one gave a rats hairy a$$.  Cleveland loses a team (for not wanting to build a new stadium I might add) and they are guaranteed a new team in 4 years WITH their old name AND a new stadium!!!  I mean, Jack Kent Cooke did everything in his power to keep Baltimore from getting a team, like when we got shafted in '95 with that expansion thing (jacksonville?!?!).  Atleast Cleveland was forewarned.  We just woke up one morning and boom the Colts have moved to Indianapolis.  It took us like 15 yrs. to get a team back, we tried to do it the "fair" way but we got the shaft in that expansions B.S., so desperate times call for desperate measures.  IMO, we didn't "steal" anything.<P>Well I just wanted to vent some feelings after I was watching some jack ass ESPN "analyst" comment on the situation.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||8
Z||000001||turbo86se||09-09-2000||01:30 AM||||well, I'm a Colts fan. Every Sunday when they play, I hang my huge Colts banner from my front porch, proudly. I was with them several years ago when they lost nearly every game, that's the reason why I started supporting them, cause the sucked! Now they're awesome! <P>My dad is a "professional" bookie, his predictions and mine are for this season's superbowl: Redskins vs. Colts. <BR>Of course the Colts will win!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
